      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, so you've made up your mind to go!\r\n—Hold, are you truly certain?\r\nYou may take more time to steel your resolve, ser.",
        "Jp" : "おっ、もう行ってくれる気になったのか！\r\n――いや、ほんとに大丈夫か？\r\nもう少し時間をかけて覚悟を固めてもいいんだぞ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446218,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, if you say you're fit, I'll not argue —\r\n'tis a boon beyond measure!",
        "Jp" : "ま、お前が大丈夫っていうんなら\r\n俺としてはありがたいこと\r\nこの上ないんだけどな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482233,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "For caution's sake, I'll explain anew.\r\nThe site is the familiar Penitentiary — that\r\ngraveyard where the lock opened of its own accord.",
        "Jp" : "念のためだ、もう一度説明しておくぞ\r\n場所はおなじみの《罪人の修獄》だ\r\n勝手に鍵が開いてた、あの墓場だよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482234,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The investigating corpsmen report a woman's\r\nlaughter echoing from all around.... Mark this\r\nwell—in a graveyard where not a soul should be!",
        "Jp" : "調査に行った隊士の話では\r\n女の笑い声があちこちから聞こえてきたそうだ――\r\n繰り返すが――誰も居るはずがない墓地で、だぞ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482236,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ugh, just the telling brings a chill— I cannot\r\ncarry a tale like this to the Vice Captain.\r\nYou're the only one I can count on!\r\nRight then, it's in your hands!",
        "Jp" : "ううっ、話してるだけで寒気がしてきた――\r\nこんな話を副隊長にするわけにはいかないからな\r\nお前だけが頼りだ！\r\nそれじゃ、任せたぞ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482232,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1905,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Scherzo",
      "Jp" : "スケルツォ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 17742,
    "GroupType" : 0,
