      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "How fares that matter?\r\nThe one about the woman's laughter \r\nheard at the Penitentiary...",
        "Jp" : "あの件はどうなった？\r\nほら、《罪人の修獄》で\r\n女の笑い声が聞こえてきたってやつ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446219,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
