      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "N-no, there's no call to rush!\r\nA thing like this demands resolve—\r\nI wit that better than most!\r\nDo not push yourself too hard!",
        "Jp" : "い、いや、急ぐことはないぞ！\r\nこういうことには覚悟が必要だからな――\r\n俺もよーくわかってる！\r\n無理はしなくていいからな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482237,
      "MsgType" : 0,
