      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Haah, I sent you off, aye... but the thought I'd\r\nhave to go searching myself if you did not\r\nreturn— that weighed heavy on the spirit, it did!",
        "Jp" : "いやぁ、送り出したはいいものの\r\n万が一お前が帰ってこなかったら\r\n次は俺が様子を見に行かなきゃなって考えたら\r\n気分が重くなってな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482238,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, what was laughing inside the Penitentiary?\r\n—A woman's spirit!\r\nKnew it — one's shown itself after all!",
        "Jp" : "で、《罪人の修獄》の中で笑ってたのは\r\n何だったんだ？\r\n――女の幽霊！\r\nやっぱり出たんだな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482239,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hmm, so an unsettling journal hinting at false\r\naccusation was left behind...",
        "Jp" : "ふむ、冤罪を示唆するような\r\n不穏な手記が遺されていたのか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482240,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas said naught but prisoners guilty of heinous\r\ncrimes, who died in gaol, lie buried there... yet\r\nmayhap some were falsely accused, and perished\r\nwith regret unspent—",
        "Jp" : "あの墓地に葬られているのは\r\n大罪を犯して獄死した囚人ばかりだと聞いていたが\r\n冤罪に問われ、無念のうちに没した者も\r\nいたのかも知れんな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482241,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Sorry to foist so eerie a task on you.\r\nAs a token of my thanks — pray, accept this.\r\nShould aught come up anew, I'm counting on you!",
        "Jp" : "気味の悪い任務を引き受けてもらって悪いな\r\n俺からの感謝の気持ちとして\r\nこれを受け取ってくれ\r\nまた何かあったら、よろしくな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482242,
      "MsgType" : 0,
